# 17. And we can measure exploitability

OpenSpiel has explicit best-response and exploitability tooling. ([GitHub][12])

So a RoboBlade competitor could have:

```text
Win rate:            71%
Elo:               1842
Meta rank:             #3

Exploitability:      0.18
```

Meaning:

> Boris looks strong, but if an opponent knows exactly how Boris plays, there exists a pretty strong counter.

Then another competitor might have:

```text
